  "scope": "New independent combined ImageJ 1.54r reference invokes actual component itemStateChanged callbacks, inherited Reset/Auto, ImagePlus navigation/setup and private final applyRGBStack. Presentation and AWT queue dispatch remain excluded. All 42 distinct first/second component-promotion pairs, nine selection forms, three axes, both directions and manual/Auto final modes produce 4536 ordered traces. A derived third component differs from the second and can repeat the first. Initial and changed selections freeze at promotion boundaries; navigation retains other-plane output; returning drafts are replaced and Reset before manual or Auto final bounds. The active preview is invariant across actual stack Apply. Two fresh compilations/runs reproduce the full fixture byte for byte. Driver sources/bytecode, relevant upstream sources/classes, Java/Javac and raw outputs are pinned. Every shared upstream/tool/helper pin matches the existing navigation reference. Native consumers check every numerical checkpoint, returning Auto range/cycle, logical preview and final full-stack hashes, immutable full captures, strict JSON replay, portable workflows, worker publication, source/selection/navigation preservation and paired Undo/Redo. Shared installed panel consumers match every trace through native actions and rendered pixels, then final stack Apply and complete records/history. Eighty-four additional cases deliver real ImGui input to component radios, stack checkbox and Apply for every pair with both endings; other mapping/selection/navigation/Auto/Reset actions remain programmatic in this matrix. The initial 756 cyclic-pair traces and 1526 consumers are retained as preliminary evidence before expansion to all pairs. One preliminary widget case missed Apply after focus was consumed in a separate headless context; source remained unchanged. The corrected driver raises the contrast panel inside the same input session and all widget cases pass; failed report and exact source variant remain. Windows/Linux each pass 9156 installed checks (4536 native API, 4536 shared panel, 84 widget cases), zero failure/error/skip, using actual disposable venv interpreters. All three installed native modules match qualified main 75dc6e0 and all prior qualified source inputs remain identical. This is new oracle/consumer coverage of already implemented behavior; no production implementation or dependency change and no unrelated broad regression rerun is claimed. Linux uses a SHA-verified nine-file native test/fixture snapshot. Temporary venvs, pytest work, class trees and native snapshots/transfers are CRC/every-member-SHA archived before exact confined removal; prior qualified installs/probes/logs and useful caches remain. The original 99 requirement/status triples and expected old Auto producer-source failure remain unchanged. Complete ImageJ/Fiji/platform/resource acceptance, richer visit orders and remaining real selection/navigation/Auto/Reset delivery and saved-stage authoring remain open.",
